        "toolName": "document_knowledge_base",
        "toolDescription": "Semantic search over the documents the user has uploaded to the knowledge base. The input should be a complete, standalone question or a descriptive phrase about the information you need - not a single keyword. Returns the passages whose meaning is closest to your query, along with the name of the file each passage came from. Use this tool for every question about document content.",
